5,1,1,talk,Victoria,,"Before we move furniture, I need to understand the recurring cost of this floor.","{""words"":14,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
6,1,1,talk,Minato,,I worry about how my body feels after sitting in one spot for eight hours.,"{""words"":15,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
7,1,1,talk,May,,My schedule is fragmented. I need to know how much time the transition will steal.,"{""words"":15,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
8,1,1,talk,Shunichi,,"We should decide who gets the worse seats deliberately, not by accident.","{""words"":12,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
9,1,1,talk,Daisuke,,I’m worried about who I’ll sit next to. It changes how much I talk to people.,"{""words"":16,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
10,1,2,talk,Victoria,,"@May, your time concern is valid, but the budget line hasn't changed since we were smaller.","{""words"":16,""mentions"":[""May""],""raw_differs"":false}"
11,1,2,talk,Minato,,"@Shunichi, I agree. If we know the noise levels, we can pick spots that are kinder.","{""words"":16,""mentions"":[""Shunichi""],""raw_differs"":false}"
12,1,2,talk,May,,"@Victoria, the budget is important, but if I lose an hour a day, that’s a huge cost.","{""words"":17,""mentions"":[""Victoria""],""raw_differs"":false}"
13,1,2,talk,Shunichi,,"@Daisuke, proximity matters. Let’s look at how the current layout affects interaction.","{""words"":12,""mentions"":[""Daisuke""],""raw_differs"":false}"
14,1,2,talk,Daisuke,,"@Shunichi, yes. I want to see if we can plan for better connections, not just desks.","{""words"":16,""mentions"":[""Shunichi""],""raw_differs"":false}"
15,1,3,talk,Victoria,,I will look into the billing basis and the facilities quote for moving power.,"{""words"":14,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
16,1,3,talk,Minato,,I want to check the sound readings and the physio’s note on chair adjustments.,"{""words"":14,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
17,1,3,talk,May,,I’ll look at the morning routine timing and the unplanned shuffles from last year.,"{""words"":14,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
18,1,3,talk,Shunichi,,I’ll check the drawn plan against the survey and the arrival times in badge records.,"{""words"":15,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
19,1,3,talk,Daisuke,,I want to see what the new joiners reported and the project strands from last spring.,"{""words"":16,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
20,1,4,talk,Victoria,,That covers the financial and physical constraints. Let’s see what the data says.,"{""words"":13,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
21,1,4,talk,Minato,,I hope the sound data helps us find a quiet corner for deep work.,"{""words"":14,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
22,1,4,talk,May,,"If the morning routine is too long, we need a layout that minimizes that friction.","{""words"":15,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
23,1,4,talk,Shunichi,,"Knowing who arrives early will help us assign the ""good"" spots fairly.","{""words"":12,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
24,1,4,talk,Daisuke,,"I’m a bit nervous, but I think looking at the past interactions will help us decide.","{""words"":16,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
