60,3,1,talk,Victoria,,"Option A seems best. It avoids the 6,200 yen re-run cost and the billing waste.","{""words"":15,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
61,3,1,talk,Minato,,Option A lets me keep my chair settings. Option B would reset them every rotation.,"{""words"":15,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
62,3,1,talk,May,,Option A saves me the 4-9 minute setup time. Option C is too chaotic for my schedule.,"{""words"":17,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
63,3,1,talk,Shunichi,,Option A allows us to assign the window seats deliberately. Option C lets the early birds win.,"{""words"":17,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
64,3,1,talk,Daisuke,,Option A lets us choose neighbors. Option C feels too random and stressful for me.,"{""words"":15,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
65,3,2,talk,Victoria,,"@Shunichi, how do we ensure the assignment is fair in Option A?","{""words"":12,""mentions"":[""Shunichi""],""raw_differs"":false}"
66,3,2,talk,Minato,,"@Victoria, maybe we group by function, but let people pick within their group?","{""words"":13,""mentions"":[""Victoria""],""raw_differs"":false}"
67,3,2,talk,May,,"@Minato, that sounds reasonable. I just want to avoid the noisy printer row if possible.","{""words"":15,""mentions"":[""Minato""],""raw_differs"":false}"
68,3,2,talk,Shunichi,,"@May, we can assign the quiet window seats to those who need focus, and the noisy ones to those who don’t.","{""words"":21,""mentions"":[""May""],""raw_differs"":false}"
69,3,2,talk,Daisuke,,"@Shunichi, I’d like to sit near someone I talk to often. Can we factor that in?","{""words"":16,""mentions"":[""Shunichi""],""raw_differs"":false}"
70,3,3,talk,Victoria,,We can use the survey data to assign seats based on preference and need.,"{""words"":14,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
71,3,3,talk,Minato,,"That sounds good. I’d prefer the window side, away from the printer.","{""words"":12,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
72,3,3,talk,May,,"I’d take a spot near the center, easy to access, but not in the noise.","{""words"":15,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
73,3,3,talk,Shunichi,,"I’ll take the corner. It’s quiet, and I can see the room.","{""words"":12,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
74,3,3,talk,Daisuke,,I’d like to sit next to May or Shunichi. I feel more comfortable talking to them.,"{""words"":16,""mentions"":[""May"",""Shunichi""],""raw_differs"":false}"
75,3,4,talk,Victoria,,Let’s vote. I think Option A is the most rational and cost-effective.,"{""words"":12,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
76,3,4,talk,Minato,,I agree. Option A is the most comfortable for me.,"{""words"":10,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
77,3,4,talk,May,,I agree. Option A saves time and reduces stress.,"{""words"":9,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
78,3,4,talk,Shunichi,,"I agree. Option A allows for deliberate, fair assignment.","{""words"":9,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
79,3,4,talk,Daisuke,,I agree. Option A feels the safest and most supportive.,"{""words"":10,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
